Hello everyone,

Following the feedback survey in July, we have updated the hybrid working
policy. The new version takes effect on Thursday 1 October 2026. Summary of
what changes:

- Anchor days move from Tuesday/Thursday to Tuesday/Wednesday for all
  teams, so cross-team meetings can be scheduled on the same days.
- The "work from anywhere" allowance increases from 2 to 4 weeks per year.
  Requests still go through your manager and must respect the tax rules
  described in section 4.
- Home office equipment budget is now a rolling 24-month allowance of $600
  rather than a one-off.

Nothing changes for people with existing flexible-working agreements.

The full policy is on the intranet under People > Policies > Hybrid
Working (version 3.0). If you have questions, ask your manager first or
drop into the People Team open hour on Wednesdays at 13:00 in Room 2A.

Thanks,
Contoso People Team
